{
  "duration": 67.0,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.559,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.039,
      "end": 3.199,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.519,
      "end": 8.479,
      "text": "Now in this problem, we are given that for the same route, the ratio of the times taken by two cars is four is to five."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.939,
      "end": 9.699,
      "text": "The question is"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.219,
      "end": 12.42,
      "text": "asking us to find the ratio of their speeds."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.779,
      "end": 14.759,
      "text": "Now, since both cars are traveling on the same route,"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.159,
      "end": 17.279,
      "text": "the distance covered by both cars is the same."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.699,
      "end": 19.559,
      "text": "So let the common distance be x kilometers."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.02,
      "end": 22.159,
      "text": "Also, because the time ratio is four is to five,"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.459,
      "end": 27.299,
      "text": "let the time taken by car A be 4y hours, and let the time taken by car B be 5y hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.76,
      "end": 28.639,
      "text": "Now we know the formula,"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.199,
      "end": 31.26,
      "text": "speed is equal to distance divided by time."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.799,
      "end": 36.819,
      "text": "So the speed of car A is x divided by 4y and the speed of car B is x divided by"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.139,
      "end": 37.419,
      "text": "5y."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.939,
      "end": 40.019,
      "text": "Now let us find the ratio of their speeds."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.34,
      "end": 43.819,
      "text": "Speed ratio is equal to x divided by 4y is to x divided by"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.139,
      "end": 44.459,
      "text": "5y."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.86,
      "end": 45.779,
      "text": "To simplify this,"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.139,
      "end": 48.499,
      "text": "we divide the first fraction by the second fraction."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.979,
      "end": 52.899,
      "text": "That becomes x divided by 4y into 5y divided by x."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.319,
      "end": 56.479,
      "text": "Here x gets canceled with x and y gets canceled with y,"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.939,
      "end": 58.339,
      "text": "so we are left with five by four."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.759,
      "end": 65.099,
      "text": "Hence, the ratio of the speeds is five is to four. So the final answer is five is to four. Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.439,
      "end": 67.0,
      "text": "the correct option is option B."
    }
  ],
